note Answers the standing work item fpq_verify_archive_claims_before_promoting. The archive's reconstruction claim was recorded at MEASURED on the strength of an experiment this process never re-ran, and the reheat condition "reconstruction fixture fails" had no fixture behind it. This makes it real: a deterministic golden GGUF, a real bonfyre-fpq roundtrip, and a measured invariant whose reheat is a number verify_fixture re-checks on demand. Still MEASURED, not PROVEN -- the FPQ math claims stay absent because no proof artifact backs them.

