  reason The reconstruction layer now has a re-runnable measured fixture, not just an archive citation, and a reheat condition that is a number. What remains before any PROVEN promotion: a fixture cut from the real qwen2.5-0.5b tensors (this fixture is synthetic-but-structured), and the FP16-passthrough / Q-K-V-bypass experiments turned into golden fixtures the same way. Priority dropped because the mechanism now exists; only coverage remains.

work fpq_execution_is_evidence_in_the_closure
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 4.0
  status delivered
  reason capability_closure now executes real FPQ when a fused representation organism dispatches. The composed chain T_FPQ -> T_SLI -> T_KVCACHE binds 3/3 to real binaries, selects the fused_pipeline form, runs bonfyre-fpq on the fixture, and promotes BonfyreFPQ health_probed -> workload_proven cited by the report digest. The loop uses FPQ, it does not only guard it.
